{"seq":46,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a0370"},"reason":"Added a note that the longest mountain range overall is the submarine mid-ocean ridge, the Andes being the longest on a continent, to explain the narrowed question.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-continental-mountain-range"}],"changes":[{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"Counting ranges under the sea, the longest mountain range on Earth is the mid-ocean ridge system; the Andes are the longest on a continent."},{"field":"notesDe","old":"","new":"Rechnet man Gebirge unter dem Meer mit, ist das System der Mittelozeanischen Rücken die längste Gebirgskette der Erde; die Anden sind die längste auf einem Kontinent."},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"Если учитывать подводные хребты, самая длинная горная система Земли – срединно-океанические хребты; Анды – самая длинная горная цепь на континенте."}],"hash":"0877e1578fb1","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"9cc06c2fa1ff3cb648cea9fe29ed35c33dcd66ecda1b3f7e7b91f5f904631b8a"},
{"seq":47,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"reworded","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w12196"},"reason":"'Longest mountain range in the world' is ambiguous: counting submarine ranges, the mid-ocean ridge system is far longer. The Andes hold the record for the longest continental range (Guinness, Wikipedia), so the question now says 'continental'; the card's words are kept in cardText.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://www.guinnessworldrecords.com/world-records/longest-continental-mountain-range"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Andes"}],"changes":[{"field":"en","old":"What is the name of the longest mountain range in the world?","new":"What is the name of the longest continental mountain range in the world?"},{"field":"de","old":"Wie heißt die längste Gebirgskette der Welt?","new":"Wie heißt die längste Gebirgskette der Welt auf dem Festland?"},{"field":"ru","old":"Как называется самая длинная горная цепь в мире?","new":"Как называется самая длинная континентальная горная цепь в мире?"},{"field":"cardText","new":"Wie heißt die längste Gebirgskette der Welt?"}],"hash":"9baec188abff","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"1ee06de0a2b7a74f37be11c42cd964fa492ae2493ee12b4d25c84b8f966ea30d"},
